    VES @ talk "走吧，我累了...去找那家{i}苍白巨龙{/i}吧。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3616
translate zh qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_bad11f44:

