    "烟雾从酒馆每个角落升腾，混合着甜腻花香般奇异的温热气息。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3617
translate zh qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_8ac356c7:

